❓ FAQ
Why Offline-First?

Field applications may operate in environments where network connectivity is unreliable. Local persistence allows important workflows to remain usable.

Why Room?

Room provides structured local persistence and integrates well with Kotlin Coroutines and Flow.

Why WorkManager?

WorkManager provides a lifecycle-aware approach to reliable background work.

Why Jetpack Compose?

Compose enables declarative, state-driven UI development and reusable UI components.

Why Clean Architecture?

It separates business rules from UI and infrastructure, improving maintainability and scalability.

